window.products.push({"id":851153,"name":"La Pastiche Christmas Roses, 1883 by Claude Monet Hand Painted Oil on Canvas with Elegant Champagne Frame, 30 in x 26 in, Multi-Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FaXmR1svL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Seen here is a prime example of Claude Monet's prototypical Impressionist style. Christmas Roses , an 1883 still life, features the distinctive use of broken color and rapid brushstrokes. Known for his \"plein air\" outdoor paintings of landmarks and gardens over the course of many hours, days, and seasons, his one-off still lifes are somehow often forgotten. This piece is anything but forgettable, with vivid color in an organic edge-to-edge composition. The petals, leaves, stamens, and bowl really pop due to his use of complementary and contrasting paints. Our meticulous reproduction is sure to brighten any environment with a pleasant, springtime feeling. Frame Description: Elegant Champagne Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FaXmR1svL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Pastiche","source_asin":"B01M2YF7SX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M2YF7SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M2YF7SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
