window.products.push({"id":851157,"name":"Linenscape 100% Organic Cotton Lace Standard Pillowcase| Percale Weave | Eyelet Lace Pillowcases | 2 Piece| 300 Thread Count| GOTS Certified| Cool| Cr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SZUzUa5KL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DECORATIVE ORGANIC BEDDING – Linenscape has combined sustainability and craftsmanship while creating these beautiful 100% Organic Cotton Lace Pillowcases. 4-inch lace work on pillows and flat sheets will leave you mesmerised and spellbound. These 2 pillowcases are of size 20\" X 30\". PERCALE WEAVE –  Technically speaking, it’s one yarn in the warp, and one yarn in the weft. But who likes to speak technically? Simply put, percale fabric is lighter in weight and more breathable, giving you a good night’s sleep. A percale cotton weave produces a matte finish, that creates a smooth pillowcase that feels crisp and cool to the touch. Just like your favourite crisp white shirt, percale pillowcases are a bedroom must-have, especially during hot summer months. GOTS CERTIFIED – Linenscape sheet set is GOTS certified. Organic cotton is grown without using any chemicals. The process of farming uses less amount of water & all our factories run on wind energy. An additional benefit is that of decreased carbon footprint. Organic cotton stems from seeds that are not genetically modified (GMO) which helps soil to retain its fertility. By buying this pillowcase, you can sleep in peace- your purchase is helping to save this planet-one pillowcase set at a time! A THOUGHTFUL GIFT – We have given you a perfect gifting idea for your near and dear ones. This product comes in a beautiful paper box which can be described as nothing less than an art motif - vibrant and a riot of colours. Paper box is laminated for securing the package. Pillowcases come packaged in a beautiful butter paper. And what’s more they are eco-friendly which makes them most thoughtful gift for – Christmas, Birthdays, New Years, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day and Anniversaries. EASY TO CARE – Cold or warm water for the wash cycle is best. Avoid using fabric softeners or chlorine on these pillowcases. If you are using a washing machine, opt for the second rinse cycle, ensure that any excess soap is washed out. Never use the dryer on the pillowcases. Remove these pillowcases immediately at the end of the drying cycle and smooth them while folding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SZUzUa5KL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINENSCAPE","source_asin":"B09M6G4BB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M6G4BB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M6G4BB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
