window.products.push({"id":851321,"name":"Vacuflo Deluxe Bare Floor Universal Central Vacuum Attachment Kit w/30ft Hose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/2192b3UD-RL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Vacuflo Deluxe Bare Floor Universal Care Kit includes: 30ft TurboGrip Hose with on/off control & 360 degree swivel, Deluxe adjustable wand, 10\" bare floor brush, 12\" bare floor brush, Carpet tool, Dusting brush, Crevice nozzle, Upholstery tool with slide off brush, Canvas tool caddy and Hose rack. This Vacuflo Bare Floor Deluxe Tool Kit is a kit for people who have only bare floors in their home. The hose is designed to work with Vacuflo and other brand Universal inlets. It’s very important that you choose the correct kit for your inlet type. We do not recommend this kit if you have carpet in your home. Cleaning carpets with a revolving roller brush is vitally necessary to maintain the beauty of your carpet by removing the dirt and dust from carpet that wear down carpet fibers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/2192b3UD-RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacuflo","source_asin":"B001KMPMO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001KMPMO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001KMPMO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":851322,"name":"SouLips Digital Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Waterproof Food Thermometer with Big Back-light Calibration Bottle Opener Magnetic Portable for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612gP0i4ZsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"To be a better griller with this gadget - SouLips Updated Design Instant Read Digital Food Cooking Thermometer Features ★ Being frustrated by overcooked meat? This upgraded digital meat thermometer fits the bill.  ★ It provides a quick, accurate and easy reading with ℉/℃ reading, large backlit screen and hold-to-read button.  ★ The foldable probe is long enough without burning your fingers.  ★ With a special design small end, you don’t have a huge hole for the juices to run out when test the temps.  ★ It supports magnetic attach on metal surface for easy storage, also frees up room in the small drawers in the kitchen. ★ Amazing gift for family members who are grilling enthusiasts. Warm Tips ★ To enjoy your cooking time with this food thermometer, pls read the User Manual firstly and get some practices beforehand. ★ To care for thermometer, kindly wash the metal probe gently & avoid immersing the body part completely in water for a long time. Packages ★ 1 x Food Cooking Thermometer (with user manual & temp guide) ★ 1 x CR2032 Battery Things You Should Know: Q: Does it come with battery?  A: Yes, it came with a ready to go CR2032 battery and a tool to open the battery compartment.  Q: How to wash it?  A: You can wash it by rinsing the probe and then wipe the water with a clean cloth.  Q: Can you measure the temp of cake and milk with this cooking thermometer?  A: Yes, this instant read digital meat thermometer also works for baking, liquids, fry oil and most kind of foods.  Q: How to change the battery?  A: Don’t worry, just use the tool included to open battery compartment on the back. Once battery is secured, use it to press down and twist the battery door back on. Easy as that! Feel free to contact us if any questions, SouLips Team are always here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612gP0i4ZsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SouLips","source_asin":"B08B1RF4DW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B1RF4DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B1RF4DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
