window.products.push({"id":851325,"name":"Bread Buddy Storage Container 2 pack set with red lids, Plastic Sandwich bread dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FzQl4kjyL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bread Buddy Fresh Bread Dispenser keeps bread fresh by keeping the bread in its original bag. Bread Buddy is the perfect storage solution for all sandwich bread! This product one-of-a-kind bread box eliminates crushed bread, bothersome twist ties, and inconvenient bag clips. The clear design allows you to see and read all of the variety, brand, and nutritional information on the bread bag or wrapper. This large bread box easily dispenses sandwich bread one slice at a time. To use, simply place the bag of bread inside the Buddy, fold the excess bag or wrapper over the edge of the container, and pull down on the outside of the bag to raise the loaf inside. It dispenses fresh bread one slice at a time with a simple pull down, pop up motion! Remember to replace the lid to keep your sandwich bread fresh. Place multiple loaves upright in a Bread Buddy to save precious counter top, pantry, and kitchen space (the perfect corner bread box). The rigid design and BPA-free plastic protect sandwich bread from ever getting squished again. The Bread Buddy is made from the highest quality, BPA-free food grade resins. Take the Bread Buddy on picnics, camping trips, and boating excursions without the fear of stale or mashed bread. Each Bread Buddy is 5.25 x 5.25 x 13.5 inches. 2 pack set with red lids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FzQl4kjyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BP6WNHF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6WNHF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6WNHF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":851326,"name":"Rechargeable Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, ASOFTY Dual Charging Smart Timing Automatic Salt Pepper Mill with Charging Base, LED Light, Adjusta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719R-LsPO2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【One Button Operation and Smart Timing】 Tap once to turn it on, during the grinding process, you can easily operate with one hand without pressing and holding the switch. In addition, the ASOFTY pepper grinder takes 10s/120s timing function, you can choose the time of grinding, You can also stop at any time with one click, let you free your hands to prepare your food. 【Dual Charging and Charging Base】 The ASOFTY electric pepper mill takes two charging methods, type-C charging port. Multifunctional charging base can be used for both charging and storage, unique contact design, supports 360° rotation during charging. At the same time, you can also use the type-C usb cable to connect the pepper grinder to charge. 【LED light and Adjustable Mill】 Unique LED light design, you can not only easily see amount of salt and pepper you put in your food, but aslo see the storage area. Turn the grinder knob at the bottom part of the device to adjust your favorite coarseness. Stepless adjustment design, Rotate clockwise into fine particles and rotate counterclockwise to grind into coarse particles. 【Hight Quality Material】 This salt grinder takes stainless steel and acrylic material, wear-resistant to prevent rust. Top quality Ceramic Rotor offers long time durability and can grind against the toughest peppercorns, green beans, sea salt or other spices. Safty design, the pepper grinder stops working automatically if it hits a stone 【Upgrade Structure and Refillable】 The upgraded structure separates the grinding area from the storage area to avoid motor corrosion. Easy to refill, assemble and disassemble, and clean. Concentric shaft structure makes grinding more uniform. Attention: Medium-capacity storage design helps keep spices fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719R-LsPO2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASOFTY","source_asin":"B09Q35DJVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q35DJVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q35DJVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
