window.products.push({"id":851668,"name":"YIMART Portable Rechargeable Electric Bladeless USB Mini Air Conditioning Refrigeration Blower Dryer Fan For Eyelash Extension (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z8N7pNcsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This mini fan is made of durable ABS Plastic and can be placed in office,living room, and bedroom. Lightweight, mini size make it convenience for outdoor. It improves upon the traditional fan which only allows fixed position cooling. Specifications: Size: 12*7*3cm/ 4.72x2.76 x1.18 inch Net weight: 103g/ 0.227lb Color: Pink Material: ABS Plastic Capacity: 400mAh Voltage: 5V Working current: 250mA Charging Time: 2 hours Working time: 1-1.5 hours Charging: Charged by USB port The USB charging cable length: 102.0 cm Features: -Portable & Mini &Lightweight -Excellent cooling performance -Air Conditioner cooling system -A strap for easy carry -Built-in Rechargeable Lithium Battery -Adjustable Stainless steel holder -Water-cooled sponge -Convenience to clean -Anti-dust design -Easy to operate -Long lifetime Note: 1. This machine isn't waterproof, so when you wet the sponge, please take it out. 2. Don't fill too much water into the sponge in case the water will spill out and wet the machine. 3. Remember to take the sponge out and dry it when you don't use the fan. How to use: Step1: Fully charge before first usage Indicator light turn to blue.And the red LED indicator lamp will light when this item is fully charged. Step2: Open the backside cover and take out the sponge. (Rinse sponge with detergent before first usage). Step3: Wet the sponge by soaking in water for 1-2 mins, make sure no overflowing. Put it back into the mini cooli. Package Included: 1 x Mini Portable Bladeless Refrigeration Fan 1x Hanging Strap 1 x USB Charging Cord","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z8N7pNcsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yimart","source_asin":"B095C8X821","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095C8X821","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095C8X821","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
