window.products.push({"id":851735,"name":"Candy Molds, 112 Fish Biscuit Molds, Fish Shape Silicone Molds for Baking Cat Treats/Cat Biscuits/Gummy/Cookies, Making Cute Gifts for Cat, Dog or Kid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FATFtbO9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD GRADE SILICONE: Fish silicone mold size is 7.87\"x11.8\"x0.4\" and the diameter of each fish shape cavity is 0.99\"x0.52\", This is a food-grade silicone mold with good heat resistance. It is suitable for ovens and microwave ovens. The silicone fish mold does not contain BPA and has no peculiar smell. It can directly and safely to contact with food. Safe for your health or your pets. MULTI-PURPOSES: Fish shape biscuits molds can be used for baking, making fish biscuits for cat treats, fish chocolate, fish wax, fish candy, fish gummy, etc. It also can be used as a festival gift or used to make small desserts or gummy to decorate cakes. It is very suitable for making healthy snacks for children. It is a good gummy maker for family parties. You can also use it to make fish biscuits as pet treats to your cat or dog as awards, and so on. EASY TO DEMOLD: The characteristics of silicone make cakes, candies, biscuits, wax, pet treats, and any other substances easily released from the mold. Without butter lubrication, and will not destroy the shape of the fish output itself, beautiful in appearance, and novices can easily make desserts or whatever you like. Imaging the happy time with the kids or your cats with the cute fish biscuits coming out from this fish mold. EASY TO CLEAN: All of our silicone molds for baking refuse to hide dirt and are easy to clean. This cat treat mold is especially easy to use and clean. Just rinse this fish mold with warm soapy water or put in the dishwasher, no residue, clean is so simple. As wax melt molds, Christmas chocolate molds, gummy molds, candy molds, cat biscuits molds, any of the above will meet your needs with this silicone molds. WHAT WE CAN PROVIDE YOU: We have various shapes of silicone gummy molds e.g. Fish molds, Christmas tree molds, Gingerbread man molds, Cartoon cat molds, Dog bone molds, Carrot molds, Lovely heart molds, Star molds, etc. Your satisfaction is our pursuit. We are confident that you can smile with satisfaction when you receive our products. If you have any questions about our silicone molds, please contact us and we will give you a satisfactory answer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FATFtbO9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amyandone","source_asin":"B09G6NPQNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G6NPQNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G6NPQNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
