window.products.push({"id":851782,"name":"Zen Earth Inspired 4\"x6\" Bamboo Recipe Box Wood Storage Chest for 200+ Recipe Cards (100 Lemon Recipe Cards, Labeleze Dividers, and 1 Clear Card Prote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VmrEXybHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Recipe Storage - You can officially get rid of your grandmother's old shoebox. Our recipe boxes are high quality, durable and designed to be passed from generation to generation. Perfect for storing secret family recipes. This recipe box has three slots, the first slot is big enough for most phones and tablets. Easily document, browse and prepare recipes - scrapbooking old family favorites plus new inspirational recipes, creating memories that last a lifetime and beyond in the kitchen Bamboo Wood Kitchen Recipe Box Bundle - Holds 200+ 4”x6” recipe cards (7.1\"L X 6.5\"W X 5.2\"H). 100 USA made FSC certified lemon recipe cards, 24 Labeleze dividers, 3 clear card protectors & bonus measurement conversion chart all included! Handmade and Eco Friendly - Others use a chemical-based lacquer on their boxes. We use a stain made out of environmentally friendly vegetable oil. Besides its sturdy lid, high quality corner protectors, and smart inclined design, it also features 3 different sized grooves you can use as recipe card, smartphone, and tablet holders! Premium Quality You Can Trust - When it comes to our family recipe boxes and high quality all-in-one bundles, we firmly believe there's no room for cutting corners. That's why we make a point if using nothing but gorgeous, natural, sustainable bamboo wood — known for its beautiful and strong feeling — as well as heavy duty clasp and hinges, careful handcrafting techniques, and strict quality control! A Beautiful Gift Idea for Friends and Loved Ones - Are you looking for a nice and thoughtful gift for one of your kitchen-savvy friends or family? This handcrafted recipe box bundle is more than just any old box; it's a chance to start a family tradition! A great choice for bakers, grillers, bartenders, foodies, and organizers. The perfect Christmas, Hannukah or Holiday present - a thoughtful wedding gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VmrEXybHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zen Earth Inspired","source_asin":"B0B9RHSNH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9RHSNH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9RHSNH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
