window.products.push({"id":851784,"name":"HARNY Winter All Season King Size Comforter Soft Quilted Down Alternative Comforter Duvet Insert with Corner Tabs,Machine Washable,Warm,Pure White,90x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514lrU9hF-L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"★[ergonomic]Through the test of 88 test subjects, the ergonomically designed quilt can fit the body, without losing warmth, and can experience quality sleep every day！ ★[extremely soft&fluffy]-harny comforter is super soft and fluffy, dedicated to providing the ultimate gentle and comfortable experience! Double-layer brushed fabric cover: quiet, strong air permeability, no tearing or bad smell. ★[premium&filling&thermal ability]--adopts premium poly fill, fluffy and well-distributed, without any concern for clumping or horrible odor. Great choice for those who can't use goose down and feather bedding. Great ability of keeping warm even on cold winter nights, maintains your bed at a cozy temperature, provides you with health and sound sleep ★[myultifunctional minimalist] classic design, available in 3 colors (white/grey/grey white) and 6 sizes (twin, full, queen, oversize queen, king, calking), can meet different needs. You can use it as a duvet or an independent quilt. It is light and breathable, very suitable for four seasons, making you comfortable all year round. It can be operated at home by yourself or as a gift for family and friends. ★[maintenance&service] you will be satisfied with our products. When you receive the product, please expose the product to sunlight to make the quilt fluffy. After using for a period of time, you can use the washing machine to rinse gently. It is recommended to clean the quilt regularly to remove dust [100% customer satisfaction is our highest honor. We provide 30-day returns and exchanges and free lifetime customer service.]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514lrU9hF-L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HARNY","source_asin":"B08PFDG9GV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PFDG9GV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PFDG9GV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":851785,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Marcia Baldwin Fine Art, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Jb8T8nHjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a portrait of a pig standing on the left side of the frame. Art has always been a passion of Mine. I wanted to know as much about art as I could possibly learn. I still strive to learn something new every day. It takes practice and patience to be a full time artist and I am finally able to devote one hundred percent of my professional life to my studio work. After many years working in and around art, making a living as an advertising designer, art teacher, photographic artisan and many other niches, I finally opened my art studio to the dedication of purely fine art. I am a trained artist, receiving a BFA and a MFA in the seventies and eighties, respectively. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Jb8T8nHjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07D3PKDF4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3PKDF4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3PKDF4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
