window.products.push({"id":851802,"name":"LOLYKITCH Whole Body Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Saute Pan 6 Quarts Deep Frying Pan, Induction Compatible Chef Cooking Pan, Sauté Pan with lid, Dishwasher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715IdmiXTHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Tri-Ply Construction】Made with a responsive aluminum core bonded together with 2 layers of durable, stainless steel all the way around for maximum durability and fast, even heat distribution. 【Honeycomb Pattern】The stainless steel honeycomb pattern forms a stunning and durable scratch- resistant surface, metal utensils safe, reduce the generation of oil smoke at the same time, extremely suitable for intensive use. 【PFOA-Free US Whitford Coating】Built with high quality US Whitford PFOA-and PTFE-free interior coating high heat tolerance, allowing for perfect searing, sauteing & frying. It also repels water and oil, allowing for quick and easy cleanup after cooking. We always recommend to heat up the pan with cooking oil to the appropriate temperature to make the pan semi-nonstick. 【Seasoning Instructions】 It is imperative to season your Lolykitch cookware to get the non-stick cooking experience. To properly season your Lolykitch cookware, bring the cookware to medium-low heat and spread 1 teaspoon of vegetable oil around the interior. Your cookware will be ready for use after leaving it on heat for 2-3 minutes and will perform better over time as it re-seasons itself from the fats in the food you cook with. 【Proper Care and Use】Wash cookware with warm soapy water before first use. Lolykitch design allows heat to be distributed faster, so we recommend cooking on medium-low heat for most foods and medium to medium-high heat when searing meats. 【Suitable for All Stove】Works on all cook stove tops, include induction, gas, electric, halogen, glass, and ceramic. The high quality stainless steels and the aluminum core make it dishwasher-safe and oven-safe up to 500°F. We always recommend to follow the included instruction for seasoning and maintaining the pan properly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715IdmiXTHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOLYKITCH","source_asin":"B0989LTZMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989LTZMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989LTZMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":851803,"name":"Twin Over Twin Bunk Bed with Bookcase, Wood Bunk Beds with Storage Cabinet/Shelves/Drawers for Kids Girls Boys Teens Adults, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GKg8vj0oS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Multi-functional Bunk Beds】: The twin over twin bunk bed is practical and beautiful, which can meet the needs of sleeping and storage at the same time. Feature a special cork board, papers can be nailed on the light brown part. It is undeniable that stylish and elegant bunk beds twin over twin can improve any bedroom and add charm to your home decoration. Available in white, gray, Espresso. 【Bunk Bed with Storage】: Our Unique twin over twin bunk bed combined with a bookcase, The bookcase consists of 6 open compartments and 2 large drawers, spacious storage space is provided for you to neatly organize books, toys, clothes and other belongings.The space under lower bed also can be used for storage of baskets and boxes, maximize your room. 【Sturdy Construction Wood Bed Frame】: Constructed by premium pine wood bed frame and reinforced hardware with strong mattress support with wood slats prevents sagging and increases mattress life, the twin over twin bunk bed ensures sturdiness and durability. And stable structure can prevent shaking when turning over, thus bringing you or your child a sweet sleep. 【Bunk Bed for Kids/Adults】: All four sides of the upper bed are equipped with protective guard rails for ultimate safety. The sturdy angled ladder makes it easy for kids to climb up and down. Both the upper bed and the lower bed are equipped with 10 wood slats to support the mattress, no box spring is needed. 【Standard Bunk Beds Twin over Twin】: Bunk Bed Dimension: 92.5\"L x 58.5\"W x 65\"H. Recommended mattress (not included) size: Upper bed: 6\"/ Lower bed: 8\"; Weight Capacity: Upper bed: 175LBS / Lower bed: 275LBS. This bunk bed with drawer and bookcase will be shipped in 3 boxes with the necessary tools and instructions. If there is any part missing or damaged during shipping, please contact us, we will help you to solve the problem ASAP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GKg8vj0oS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellemave","source_asin":"B097SZM6SN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097SZM6SN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097SZM6SN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
