window.products.push({"id":851975,"name":"Porcelain Enameled Tea Kettles，2 Quart Tea pot，AIDEA Whistling Tea Kettle with Heat Proof Handle， Suitable for Stovetop Induction - Turquoise Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913S0hhXESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💛AIDEA Enamel-on-Steel Tea Kettle 💛Why you’ll love it：if you’re looking for a rustic and pretty tea kettle that fills easily, heats up quickly, pours drip-free, cleans easily and can be used for a long time, the AIDEA enamel-on-steel tea kettle is just the right choice. 💛Features： 💛1,Heat-Resistant Handle Ergonomically designed and silicone coated handle allows you to comfortably grab the tea kettle without feeling extreme heat. Easy to lift, fill and pour. Simple-touch button provides easy open & close and makes one hand pouring possible. 💛2,Loud & Audible Whistle The strong whistle of the stovetop kettle demands barely your attention. You can’t forget you are making tea with this best whistling tea kettles. 💛3,Two Water Filling Methods The spout of the kettle is a unique design, allowing you to quickly fill the water through the spout as well as to open the lid to fill the water. 💛4,Rustic Charm and Elegant Taste Enamel-on-Steel bright and long lasting color; anti-rust; heats up water quickly. 💛5,MAKE A HEALTHY & CHIC GIFT The perfect gift for Christmas,Thanksgiving, birthdays, housewarmings, or anniversaries! Use and Care: 💛 Perfect for boiling water; use as a tea pot; serve coffee or making tea;even as a decoration.💛 Versatile and chic,compatible with any occasions, such as kitchen,home and office,cafe,restaurant,serve on a party or family gathering etc.💛 Perfect as a gift at any occasions,especially Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanks Giving and more. Nice gift for friends' birthdays,weddings, anniversaries or New Year's gift or Housewarming gift for family💛 Hand wash ONLY.💛 Always use mitt or towel to lift the teapot for safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913S0hhXESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIDEA","source_asin":"B079HT5FC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079HT5FC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079HT5FC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":851976,"name":"GripCote Ultra - Anti-Slip Waterproof Coating for All Area Rugs - Good for Cotton, Wool, Persian Rugs and Much More. (Nontoxic and No Residue) (16 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"GripCote-Ultra is a water based, eco-bio friendly coating that has been formulated for application on tightly woven and artistic floor coverings. This includes Persian carpets, hallway runners, wool and cotton throw rugs used indoors, on patios or other covered areas. GripCote-Ultra will provide an effective and lasting non-slip surface on practically all common surfaces in homes and businesses. In addition to firmly anchoring the floor coverings, GripCote-Ultra’s water and oil resistant structure will protect the coated surface from being damaged by liquid spills. GripCote-Ultra replaces carpet pads, foam tapes and the like with a more effective and lasting non-slip coating that can be easily brushed or rolled on. It can also be sprayed when applied to large surface areas. One gallon of GripCote-Ultra will cover approximately 300 plus square feet of surface area . Individual results may vary. GripCote-Ultra will not be affected by most everyday liquids including alcohol, beverages, and cleaners. It acts as a protective barrier against spills and will slow down the wear and tear of the protected surfaces. The cured film is extremely flexible and will not change the feel of the carpet, nor will it damage flooring materials it contacts or the surface to which it has been applied. GripCote-Ultra will provide excellent slip resistance on almost any type of substrate including wall-to- wall carpeting, ceramics, fiberglass, glass, metal, plastic, rubber, vinyl and wood. GripCote-Ultra will not stain or mar the surface it comes in contact with and will not leave a sticky residue on hands, clothing or the floor surface beneath it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liquiguard","source_asin":"B07XJQQ5G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-851976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XJQQ5G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XJQQ5G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
